{"id":"irgendwie","lemma":"irgendwie","pos":"adv","rank":402,"glosses":["somehow (in some unknown or unspecific manner)","for some reason; used to express uncertainty about the justification for an opinion"],"ipa":"/ɪɐ̯ɡəntˈviː/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/0/0c/De-irgendwie.ogg/De-irgendwie.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Kann ich dir irgendwie helfen?","en":"Can I help you do something?","words":[{"g":"can, to be able to","l":"können"},{"g":"I"},{"g":"(to) you","l":"du"},null,{"g":"to help"}]},{"text":"Kannst du mir irgendwie helfen?","en":"Can't you do something to help me?","words":[{"g":"can, to be able to","l":"können"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"(to) me","l":"ich"},null,{"g":"to help"}]},{"text":"Können wir irgendwie helfen?","en":"Is there anything we can do to help?","words":[{"g":"can, to be able to"},{"g":"we"},null,{"g":"to help"}]},{"text":"Es ist irgendwie lustig.","en":"It's kind of funny.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/390655","words":[{"g":"it"},{"g":"is","l":"sein"},null,{"g":"funny, humorous"}]},{"text":"Wir müssen irgendwie Geld verdienen.","en":"I have to make money somehow.","words":[{"g":"we"},{"g":"to have to"},null,{"g":"money"},{"g":"to make money, to earn"}]}]}